### Koleksi request Mount Tracker API
### Pakai ekstensi VS Code "REST Client" (humao.rest-client): klik "Send Request" di atas tiap request.
### Tes otomatis semua endpoint: php tests/api_test.php http://127.0.0.1:8000

@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000
# Isi setelah login (ambil data.token dari response login)
@token = ISI_TOKEN_DI_SINI

### Status server
GET {{base}}/

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- 1. Auth
POST {{base}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "pendaki1", "email": "pendaki1@contoh.test", "password": "rahasia123", "confirmPassword": "rahasia123" }

### Login (email atau username)
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "login": "demo", "password": "demo1234" }

### Lupa password -> kode 6 digit dikirim ke email (lihat Mailpit http://localhost:8025 atau Gmail)
POST {{base}}/forgot
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "demo", "email": "demo@mounttracker.local" }

### Reset password dengan kode dari email
POST {{base}}/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "demo@mounttracker.local", "code": "123456", "newPassword": "demo1234", "confirmPassword": "demo1234" }

### Login Google (idToken dari aplikasi)
POST {{base}}/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{ "idToken": "TOKEN_DARI_GOOGLE" }

### Profil
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PUT {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "displayName": "Pendaki Demo" }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- 2-3. Gunung, jalur, pos
GET {{base}}/mountains

###
GET {{base}}/mountains?q=rin

###
GET {{base}}/mountains?difficulty=extreme

###
GET {{base}}/mountains/1

###
GET {{base}}/mountains/1/trails

###
GET {{base}}/trails/1/checkpoints

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- 7. Kontak darurat
GET {{base}}/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ibu", "phone": "081234567890", "relationship": "Keluarga" }

###
PUT {{base}}/contacts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "relationship": "Keluarga inti" }

###
PUT {{base}}/contacts/1/primary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
DELETE {{base}}/contacts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- 4. Pendakian
POST {{base}}/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mountainId": 1, "trailId": 1, "groupSize": 3, "plannedDays": 2, "startDate": "2026-12-24", "notes": "Bawa jas hujan" }

### Pendakian aktif (atau rencana terdekat) + status pos + estimasi
GET {{base}}/trips/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/trips/1/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/trips/1/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "locations": [ { "latitude": -8.3725, "longitude": 116.529, "altitudeM": 1160, "accuracyM": 8 }, { "source": "unavailable" } ] }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- 5. Check-in pos
POST {{base}}/trips/1/checkins
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "checkpointId": 1 }

###
GET {{base}}/trips/1/checkpoints
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/trips/1/finish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/trips/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Riwayat
GET {{base}}/trips?status=finished&include=locations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/trips/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- 6. Health
POST {{base}}/health
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bpm": 118, "altitudeM": 2400, "spo2": 88, "temperatureC": 36.6, "steps": 9500, "calories": 640, "isSimulated": true }

###
GET {{base}}/health?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- 7. SOS
POST {{base}}/sos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "latitude": -8.39, "longitude": 116.5, "time": "2026-11-15T10:00:00+07:00", "type": "injury", "message": "Kaki terkilir" }

###
GET {{base}}/sos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/sos/1/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "resolved" }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- 8. Cuaca per jam
GET {{base}}/weather?lat=-8.41&lng=116.46&hours=12

###
GET {{base}}/weather?mountainId=1

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Laporan kendala
POST {{base}}/issues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "category": "Peta", "description": "Peta lambat dimuat" }
